  "scope": "Thirty-six actual GameSession stage6 completion/ending/staff/result routes with original resources, six loadouts, continued/uncontinued endings and resource delays0/9/44. Artificial completion boundary and controlled invulnerability during the380-frame ending-entry wait; not a natural campaign. Each actual opcode7 resource stays undecoded until its job; uncontinued endings also load staff, while original continued scripts finish without staff; script clock/instruction held, ending callback/animation/draw continue, then actual resources/templates activate and reach Results. Completes actual keyboard name entry, validates title100/ascii19, continued ending returns to Main directly, no-continue ending offers title101 ReplaySave then cancels back to Main. GPU/audio, native thread scheduling and whole native ending equivalence excluded.",
